# LANDFALL: the thumper (the Pulse Generator's job): each thump burns one
# of a resource rolled per planet (ferns here) and knocks out every hostile
# creature in the room at once; a big shell is left an empty shell; the
# locals are spared; blue blocks sink into the ground.
game landfall
wait 5
cheat nomobs
cheat planet 2
cheat hold 4 -1
cheat pos 40 82
cheat mob 3 200 113
cheat mob 4 240 30
cheat mob 0 60 20
cheat mob 6 220 60
cheat tile 5 7 9
cheat tile 6 7 9
expect mobs == 4
expect hostiles == 3
expect friendlies == 1
# no ferns: a buzz, and ferns flash
press A
expect flash2 > 0
expect hostiles == 3
cheat res 2 3
press A
expect res2 == 2
expect kills == 2
expect hostiles == 0
expect shells == 1
expect friendlies == 1
expect tile_5_7 == 10
expect tile_6_7 == 10
# blue blocks sunk: she walks over them
cheat pos 70 114
hold RIGHT 30
expect px > 100
